The desire for consumers to enhance their outdoor living spaces with water-sensing and battery-powered alternatives, hardscapes, lighting and other outdoor living-related products provides us with additional future growth opportunities, and we continually add products to take advantage of technological advancements and the development of sustainable, energy-efficient and more aesthetically attractive products.

